{"unit_id":"deaa183a60383520724f","title":"提案五                                      提案人︰審查組","kind":"proposal","blocks":[{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p4-b15","raw_text":"提案五                                      提案人︰審查組 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":50,"bbox":[42.599998474121094,406.1183776855469,543.1500244140625,425.0302429199219]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p4-b16","raw_text":"案由：追認重申及討論南區糖尿病下列用藥審查共識。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":26,"bbox":[42.599998474121094,433.78497314453125,410.4599914550781,448.78497314453125]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p4-b17","raw_text":"說明： \n","start_char":0,"end_char":5,"bbox":[42.599998474121094,458.7449645996094,92.0999984741211,473.7449645996094]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p4-b18","raw_text":"一、 口服降血糖藥物Metformin使用最大耐受劑量已調低為1000mg，業已於「110\n","start_char":0,"end_char":46,"bbox":[57.599998474121094,481.2384033203125,552.6644897460938,500.4029846191406]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p4-b19","raw_text":"年3月3日第一次南區委員會會議」通過。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":21,"bbox":[93.59854125976562,509.55706787109375,352.4820861816406,523.5970458984375]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p4-b20","raw_text":"  二、糖尿病用藥TZD、DPP4i、SGLT2i 三者得互相轉換：符合這三類藥物的給付規\n","start_char":0,"end_char":46,"bbox":[42.577178955078125,534.5202026367188,552.9480590820312,548.5601806640625]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p4-b21","raw_text":"定並檢附起始治療的相關病歷與檢驗報告，經具體詳實記載新的臨床症狀，\n","start_char":0,"end_char":34,"bbox":[84.94990539550781,559.5956420898438,546.8294067382812,573.6356201171875]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p4-b22","raw_text":"有轉換的必要時，TZD、DPP4i、SGLT2i 三者得互相轉換。例如：因水腫將TZD\n","start_char":0,"end_char":44,"bbox":[84.94990539550781,584.5587768554688,552.8890991210938,598.5987548828125]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p4-b23","raw_text":"轉成DPP4i；或有CHF、CKD、Albuminuria 將DPP4i(或TZD)轉成SGLT2i 等，\n","start_char":0,"end_char":54,"bbox":[84.93582153320312,609.5219116210938,556.3007202148438,623.5618896484375]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p4-b24","raw_text":"業已於「110 年5 月26 日第二次南區委員會會議」通過。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":32,"bbox":[84.93585205078125,634.5973510742188,445.4732360839844,648.6373291015625]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p4-b25","raw_text":"  三、什麼情況可以開立TZD，DPP4 and SGLT2 inhibitors？ \n","start_char":0,"end_char":44,"bbox":[42.57716369628906,659.5604248046875,427.5960693359375,673.6004028320312]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p4-b26","raw_text":"1、已接受Metformin使用劑量達1000mg/day，三個月以上，且HbA1仍大於等於\n","start_char":0,"end_char":47,"bbox":[82.9000244140625,684.5235595703125,552.9577026367188,698.5635375976562]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p4-b27","raw_text":"7%之第二型糖尿病人。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":13,"bbox":[110.88168334960938,709.5989990234375,257.8243103027344,723.6389770507812]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p4-b28","raw_text":"2、Metformin有禁忌症（如eGFR<30）或副作用，即可第一線開立。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":40,"bbox":[82.92803955078125,734.5621337890625,502.8503723144531,748.6021118164062]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p4-b29","raw_text":"3、80歲以上第二型糖尿病患者，以前未使用過Metformin者(醫師裁量)；如果\n","start_char":0,"end_char":42,"bbox":[82.91400146484375,759.5252075195312,552.810302734375,773.565185546875]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p4-b30","raw_text":"病患是80歲以前就已經使用metformin 且病情穩定，Creatinine正常的病\n","start_char":0,"end_char":44,"bbox":[104.12847900390625,784.6006469726562,552.3062744140625,798.640625]},{"page":5,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p5-b1","raw_text":"患，雖達80歲了，仍可繼續處方metformin。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":27,"bbox":[104.16000366210938,37.11394500732422,384.1737365722656,51.15394592285156]},{"page":5,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p5-b2","raw_text":" 四、什麼情況可以開立DPP4/SGLT2 inhibitors複方製劑？一定要連續2次\n","start_char":0,"end_char":45,"bbox":[49.55841064453125,62.18938446044922,504.7071533203125,76.22938537597656]},{"page":5,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p5-b3","raw_text":"HbA1c>7.5%嗎？ \n","start_char":0,"end_char":14,"bbox":[91.55206298828125,87.15251922607422,196.59934997558594,101.19252014160156]},{"page":5,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p5-b4","raw_text":"1、不需要，只要第6個月的HbA1c>7.5%即可。目前健保規範為限用於已接受\n","start_char":0,"end_char":40,"bbox":[90.58330535888672,112.11565399169922,552.70849609375,126.15565490722656]},{"page":5,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p5-b5","raw_text":"過最大耐受劑量的metformin，且併用SGLT-2或DPP-4抑制劑治療至少6個\n","start_char":0,"end_char":43,"bbox":[104.60923767089844,137.19110107421875,545.7319946289062,151.23109436035156]},{"page":5,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p5-b6","raw_text":"月，糖化血色素值(HbA1c)仍高於7.5%者（僅限使用有相同成分的複方製\n","start_char":0,"end_char":38,"bbox":[104.6092529296875,162.15423583984375,545.7488403320312,176.19422912597656]},{"page":5,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p5-b7","raw_text":"劑）。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":5,"bbox":[104.6092529296875,187.11737060546875,153.62289428710938,201.15736389160156]},{"page":5,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p5-b8","raw_text":"2、可參閱南區委員會網站提供的「三高用藥查檢表」。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":27,"bbox":[98.60012817382812,212.19281005859375,448.5752258300781,226.23280334472656]},{"page":5,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p5-b9","raw_text":"辦法：請討論。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":9,"bbox":[42.552459716796875,237.15594482421875,147.61378479003906,251.19593811035156]},{"page":5,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p5-b10","raw_text":"決議：照案通過。  \n","start_char":0,"end_char":11,"bbox":[42.599998474121094,262.11395263671875,168.77999877929688,276.1539306640625]}],"source_quality":[]}